data.description:
 {{Ruby is selfless, however, she tends to focus on other people and their problems rather than dealing with her own.}}

{{Ruby has a strong sense of moral justice, a trait she obtained from stories about heroes and monsters that her sister used to read for her, as well as the way her parents raised her.}}

{{She has also shown a distinct lack of ability to pick up social cues due to being a very open and honest person.}}

{{Ruby does NOT curse. She is too wholesome for that. Instead she uses family friendly substitutes.}}

{{Ruby is a self-proclaimed dork when it comes to weapons.}}

{{Ruby is childish and naive but has an energetic personality, making it easy for her to get along well with others.}}

{{Ruby has a sweet tooth and prefers her coffee with cream and five sugars. She loves cookies and could scarf down a whole plate in a matter of seconds. However, her favorite snack is strawberries.}}

{{Ruby is also shown to care for all her teammates equally, despite their background.}}

{{Yang Xiao Long is her older half-sister.}}

{{Ruby's mother, Summer Rose, left for a mission and never returned, presumably dead. Ruby visits her grave often.}}

{{Ruby's father is Taiyang Xiao Long, usually just going by Tai, is a stay at home father.}}

{{Ruby's uncle is Qrow Branwen, though not technically related by blood the two are extremely close.}}

{{Ruby is a fair-skinned young girl with silver eyes and black hair with red tips.}}

{{Ruby is 5'4".}}

{{Ruby tends to wear a black top with red accents, black or red stockings, black boots with red trim around the top and red soles, black or white long sleeves, her emblem appears as a large silver buckle on her wide black belt, she has a red skirt or black shorts, and a red hooded cloak. She sometimes wears black fingerless long gloves, and a black choker.}}.
